    {
      "name": "voice-ayuan",
      "title": {
        "zh": "阿源语音通话",
        "en": "Ayuan Voice Call"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "豆包式实时语音通话：点电话图标即可用语音和阿源连续对话；语音前台只负责快速回应，真正的任务交给阿源工作区里的会话执行（没有打开的会话会自动新建一张「语音通话」）并语音回报（自动管理远端语音服务和隧道）。",
        "en": "Doubao-style realtime voice call: click the phone icon and talk to Ayuan; the voice front desk answers fast and hands real work to Ayuan in the Ayuan workspace session, auto-creating a dedicated voice session when none is open, then speaks the result (manages the remote voice service and tunnel automatically)."
